Not knowing if it would ever be of use to us, we
nevertheless decided to buy the strange map.

"Rivers, forests, and mountains," Esher said 
sourly, glancing at the map as I stowed it away 
in my pack, "Why, this place could be anywhere!"

"Yes," answered Praxix, "and I fear that is 
precisely where we are headed."
