Minar went on ahead, climbing a nearby ridge in 
hopes of getting a better view. He returned, 
bringing strange news. "There is smoke rising up
from behind the ridge. I thought perhaps it was 
a fire, but the plume of smoke is small and 
localized, as if it were coming from a hearth or
campfire. And that in itself is odd, for nobody 
lives up here, at least not that I have ever 
come across."
