We each scanned the stream for gold, with little
luck. The clouds, dark and heavy, began to rain 
down upon us. "Look!" said Bergon, pointing at 
the chain lightning off to the north. Seconds 
later, the earth shook with the roar of thunder.
"It is not far now," he added, as his eyes 
drifted to the blackening sky.
