Runoff from the nearby hills was forming into 
numerous streams, each coursing into the main 
channel in which we searched in vain for gold. 
Crash! A tree nearby cracked in two by a stroke 
of lightning. Rain was falling now in buckets, 
and Bergon screamed for us to take cover. As I 
turned upstream, a great torrent of water was 
heading right at me!
