Praxix now withdrew some earth and fire essences
and cast them at his staff, causing it to glow 
with a brilliant red light. "A good thing we 
found fire essence," Praxix said, blankly. "I 
only hope I didn't use too much."

"Some Wizard!" replied Esher. "Heaven help us!"
