With some hesitation, I decided to wait outside 
of the chamber until I could see who was coming.
And then it came, whatever creature it was that 
inhabited these halls. It moved slowly, but 
gracefully, to Minar's side, as if checking on 
his health. Relieved, I was about to greet this 
unknown being, when I noticed the ropes which 
bound together Minar's hands and feet! A moment 
later, the being glided out of the room, and I 
again reentered.
