Bergon sent Minar off to scout around the area, 
which he did. After an hour, though, he had not 
returned and Bergon was alarmed enough to set us
out searching for him. We split up into two 
groups; Praxix and I went toward the hills, and 
the others followed the canyon floor. Before 
long, I found that I had wandered out of sight 
of Praxix.
 
 
 
 
