Bergon replied, "You are most gracious, Agrith, 
and we would be foolish indeed to decline your 
offer." Agrith bowed slightly, then motioned to 
one of his men, who stepped forward. "This is 
Hurth, one of my sons. He shall be your guide 
through Reth a-Zar!"

Agrith handed Hurth a flaming torch to help 
guide our way, and then the two Dwarves embraced
in their fashion. With a motion of his arm, 
Agrith signalled the others to follow, and 
quietly he led them away into the gloom of the 
cavern's depths.
