caverns.

"It is said that the Dwarves built their Reth 
a-Zar, their Road Under the Mountains, many long
ages ago. Four gates there were, each linking 
the Dwarves' kingdom with the lands above. If 
memory serves, they were the Bern i-Lav, gateway
to the plains; Bern i-Fen, gateway to the 
forests; Bern i-Zar, gateway to the mountains; 
and Bern i-Lan, the Gate to Heaven."
