Elves are among the four races which first 
populated the lands. Preferring to live among 
the verdant forests, they were known in the 
ancient tongue as El-fen, meaning 'from the 
forest.'  It is said that they have lived so 
long with the trees that they have grown quite a
bit alike. But few have survived the long years,
and happy is the day we should meet them."
