finally climbed through the heavy oak door which
led into the Sunset Tower.

The view was magnificent! The sun was just 
setting, and the western sky was ablaze with 
colors reflected by the high wispy clouds at the
horizon. To the east, far-off and shrouded in 
cloud, stood this mighty tower's twin: the 
Sunrise Tower, home of Astrix.
