language further," he said, "I never knew that 
the runic language read from right to left!"

Once inside, we found small pouches of the 
magical essences of water, air, and earth, 
pleasing Praxix greatly. "We can never have 
enough of these essences," he said.

Convinced there was nothing further to be found 
inside the storeroom, we returned to the nearby 
fork.
