Praxix' plan was this: to create a diversion 
which would draw the entire contingent of orcs 
in his direction, thereby allowing the group to 
pass unseen through the junction. And so, taking
the essence of earth from his pouch, he cast the
enchantment.

A great roar erupted from the earth, and the 
ground started to split before him. The 
unsuspecting orcs were startled and frightened, 
and were soon grabbing their weapons. It was 
lucky, though, that their confusion distracted 
them enough to momentarily protect Praxix from 
their view.
