down the road in Praxix' direction, howling 
their war-cries. But Praxix had prepared his 
elevation spell beforehand, and he rose into the
air in time to marvel at the sight of a dozen or
so rampaging orcs charging down the halls 
beneath him. Descending back to earth, Praxix 
brushed himself off, retrieved his staff, and 
nonchalantly walked back to the junction.

"Come along, come along!" he said, prodding us 
with his staff. "I expect they'll be back soon 
enough."

"I am impressed," said Hurth, and so were we 
