Ahead, the passage opened up into a wider hall, 
and we moved quickly in anticipation of escape. 
But the hall ended blindly. All around, the 
sound of water was nearly deafening, and moment 
by moment, the dull thump of orc footsteps moved
ever closer; it appeared that tragedy was close 
