one obvious disadvantage. What's more, they were
one and the same - the narrow entry into our 
chamber.

On the one hand, it would be a simple matter to 
dispatch the orcs one at a time as they stumbled
into our midst. On the other hand, they might 
not oblige us, in which case we were trapped.
