he made his way across the bridge, the boards 
creaking and groaning with each step he took. 
Halfway across, the board beneath his feet gave 
way, and he was nearly over the side when his 
arm caught hold of a supporting brace. Pulling 
himself to his feet, he realized that getting to
the castle and back again would be chancy at 
best.
