"In fact, we did have someone in mind," Bergon 
replied. "His name was Bendor, I believe."

"Now that's a laugh," the harbormaster replied, 
chortling. "I can't imagine what use he'll be to
you, but you'll find him aboard the Zephyr - 
that's on the third pier, fourth boat to the 
left. If you don't have any luck with the old 
sot, try over at the Elfentide or the South Seas
- they're both in port and available for 
charter. Bendor, indeed! You folks have 
yourselves a fine evening." He laughed again, 
pointed out the two other boats he had 
suggested, and strode back into town.
